WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
Here, in the heart of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, a land that grows each day with a

2
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:12.400
clear vision and unstoppable ambition. Cities rise, roads evolve with precision,

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.920
and an economy ascends with confidence toward the future. In this dynamic market,

4
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:23.680
where the world's biggest brands compete, our story began. The story of a Saudi company that

5
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:29.840
believed in quality and in its ability to make a difference. This is the story of Lucas Oil,

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.320
in Saudi Arabia. It all started in a small car repair workshop with limited resources,

7
00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:42.800
but an unshakable dream. Years of hands-on work shaped our deep understanding of the automotive

8
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:49.040
world, mechanics, electrical systems, and diagnostics. That knowledge opened the doors

9
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.000
to a new field, equipping workshops and industrial facilities across the Kingdom.

10
00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.720
Over time, Scan Tool Line became one of the most trusted names in Saudi Arabia and neighboring

11
00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:07.280
countries. Through our partnership with Tomad, we discovered a new name in the world of lubricants:

12
00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:13.200
Lucas Oil. It wasn't known yet in Saudi Arabia, but its quality caught our attention.

13
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:20.480
We followed its performance in the United States, on tracks, in garages, and in motorsports. That's

14
00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:26.720
when we realized we were looking at a brand born of innovation and true craftsmanship. Entering the

15
00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:33.760
