16
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:40.320
was driven by mechanics recommendations. Most mechanics chose products that offered higher profit,

17
00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:46.960
not better performance. In a market dominated by brands over a century old, we started from zero,

18
00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:53.920
with confidence in our product, and faith in the future. We started with belief, not budget.

19
00:01:53.920 --> 00:02:00.640
Despite our success in the industrial equipment business, we made a bold decision to shift completely

20
00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:09.280
toward a new future, a future defined by Lucas Oil. We moved from selling machines and diagnostic devices

21
00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:15.600
to specializing in lubricants. It was a tough choice, but it became the turning point

22
00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:22.320
that ignited our next chapter of growth and passion. We had the honor to meet Mr. Forrest Lucas in the

23
00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:28.720
United States. We visited the factory and witnessed how quality is built with care and conviction.

24
00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:36.960
In that meeting, he shared a simple piece of advice that changed our path. From that day,

25
00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:43.360
we embraced a word-of-mouth marketing philosophy. Our customers became our greatest ambassadors.

26
00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:51.280
We returned to Saudi Arabia with new energy and vision. We joined exhibitions and sponsored motorsport

27
00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:58.640
