28
00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:07.600
It was about standing side by side with the champions of Saudi motorsports. Saudi Arabia is transforming at an

29
00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:15.680
unprecedented pace. Cities pulse with life. The economy drives regional growth. And within this momentum,

30
00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:23.040
we found our place. Because true growth isn't made of money alone. It comes from faith, vision,

31
00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:30.000
and relentless work. Our growth wasn't just about sales. It was about building a solid organization

32
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:37.120
from within. We expanded our teams, strengthened our sales structure, and implemented advanced digital

33
00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:43.200
