34
00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:51.280
Today, our distribution network serves over 1,600 dealers across the kingdom, supported by real-time

35
00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:58.400
monitoring of inventory and delivery operations. To reward our partners, we launched a comprehensive loyalty

36
00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:05.280
program that offers tiered financial incentives and rewards, encouraging sustained growth and mutual success.

37
00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:13.440
To expand beyond additives and reach consumers directly, we took a strategic step. The creation of

38
00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:20.400
AutoLube, a chain of Lucas Oil-branded service centers. Through these centers, customers experience

39
00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:28.000
LUCAS products first-hand from engine oil to gear oil, brake fluid, and steering systems. Today,

40
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:36.480
AutoLube operates five branches in five cities, employing over 73 technicians and staff, serving more than 3,000

41
00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:46.080
