43
00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:18.800
By the year 2025, we will reach $3.8 million, which represents a remarkable leap as our sales in 2024 were $2.8 million. This means that in 2025, our purchases increased by $1 million.

44
00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:33.840
AutoLube's own Lucas Oil purchases grew from $63,700 in 2021 to $137,000 in 2022 to $525,000 in 2023,

45
00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:42.240
