57
00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:06.720
Our vision is clear: To make Lucas Oil a leading brand in the Saudi lubricants market. And to expand to 20

58
00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:14.880
branches by 2030, alongside a wider nationwide distribution network. This is our story. The story of a team that

59
00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:22.160
believed in its mission, overcame challenges, and built leadership through faith and persistence. And by the

60
00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.920
